     3,
     "<div class=\"gmail_extra\"><div class=\"gmail_quote\"><blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0 0 0 .8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">Thanks for the solution!<div><div><br><br>On Thursday, September 7, 2017 at 5:32:36 PM UTC-4, <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">bena...@gmail.com</a> wrote:<blockquote class=\"gmail_quote\" style=\"margin:0;margin-left:0.8ex;border-left:1px #ccc solid;padding-left:1ex\"><div dir=\"ltr\">A rightward facing triangle is available as a UTF-8 character, 9668.<div><br></div><div>To using the collapse manipulator from <a href=\"https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/devel/bioc/vignettes/ggtree/inst/doc/treeManipulation.html#collapse-clade\" rel=\"nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.bioconductor.org/packages/devel/bioc/vignettes/ggtree/inst/doc/treeManipulation.html%23collapse-clade&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792482667231000&amp;usg=AOvVaw35lGvuuyq93GUXyvEoMVJp\">collapse clade</a>, you can then annotate the tip with the triangle as a geom_text2. You will need to change the hjust and vjust to adjust position and the cex to make it the right size. For example, if you wanted to collapse node 232 from the example bird.families dateset from ape:</div><div><br></div><div><br></div><div style=\"background-color:rgb(250,250,250);border:1px solid rgb(187,187,187);word-wrap:break-word\"><code><div><span style=\"color:#000\">library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>library</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">ape</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>data</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bird</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">families</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>coll </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ggtree</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">bird</span><span style=\"color:#660\">.</span><span style=\"color:#000\">families</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_tiplab</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">cex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> xlim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">70</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> ylim</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#066\">130</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>coll </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> coll </span><span style=\"color:#660\">%&gt;%</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> collapse</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">node</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">232</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>coll </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> coll </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_text2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">subset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">node </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">232</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\">intToUtf8</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#066\">9668</span><span style=\"color:#660\">),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> hjust </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">vjust</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">45</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)</span><span style=\"color:#000\"><br>coll </span><span style=\"color:#660\">&lt;-</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> coll </span><span style=\"color:#660\">+</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> geom_text2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">aes</span><span style=\"color:#660\">(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">subset</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=(</span><span style=\"color:#000\">node </span><span style=\"color:#660\">==</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#066\">232</span><span style=\"color:#660\">)),</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> cex</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">1.5</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> vjust</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#066\">0.2</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> label</span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#080\">&quot;Group&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#660\">,</span><span style=\"color:#000\">hjust </span><span style=\"color:#660\">=</span><span style=\"color:#000\"> </span><span style=\"color:#660\">-.</span><span style=\"color:#066\">5</span><span style=\"co